---
// 4.5 — Contribute upstream responsibly: decision tree
---

<div class="tree-wrap">
  <div class="tree-label">BEFORE REPORTING A BUG UPSTREAM</div>
  <div class="tree">
    <div class="tree-node tree-start">
      <div class="tn-text">Found unexpected behaviour in the original tool?</div>
    </div>
    <div class="tree-branch">
      <div class="tree-branch-inner">
        <div class="tree-edge tree-edge-yes">
          <div class="tree-edge-label">Yes</div>
          <div class="tree-edge-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tree-node">
          <div class="tn-text">Can you reproduce it with the original tool alone — no rewrite involved?</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tree-branch">
          <div class="tree-branch-inner">
            <div class="tree-edge tree-edge-yes">
              <div class="tree-edge-label">Yes</div>
              <div class="tree-edge-line"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="tree-node">
              <div class="tn-text">Have you verified with real data (not AI-generated test cases)?</div>
            </div>
            <div class="tree-branch">
              <div class="tree-branch-inner">
                <div class="tree-edge tree-edge-yes">
                  <div class="tree-edge-label">Yes</div>
                  <div class="tree-edge-line"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="tree-node tree-node-ok">
                  <div class="tn-icon">✓</div>
                  <div class="tn-text">Report the bug — politely, with a minimal reproducible example</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="tree-branch-inner">
                <div class="tree-edge tree-edge-no">
                  <div class="tree-edge-label">No</div>
                  <div class="tree-edge-line"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="tree-node tree-node-wait">
                  <div class="tn-icon">⏸</div>
                  <div class="tn-text">Verify with real data first. AI agents can be confidently wrong.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tree-branch-inner">
            <div class="tree-edge tree-edge-no">
              <div class="tree-edge-label">No</div>
              <div class="tree-edge-line"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="tree-node tree-node-stop">
              <div class="tn-icon">✗</div>
              <div class="tn-text">It's in your rewrite. Fix it there — don't file upstream.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="tree-note">
    Maintainers of open-source tools are often volunteers. A false bug report wastes their time and strains the relationship you want to build.
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .tree-wrap {
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .tree-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .tree {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
  }

  .tree-node {
    background: var(--bg-primary);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-md);
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .tree-start {
    border-color: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.25);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .tree-node-ok {
    border-color: rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.3);
    background: rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.04);
  }

  .tree-node-wait {
    border-color: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.3);
    background: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.03);
  }

  .tree-node-stop {
    border-color: rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.3);
    background: rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.04);
  }

  .tn-icon {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 1px;
  }

  .tree-node-ok   .tn-icon { color: rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.9); }
  .tree-node-wait .tn-icon { color: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.9); }
  .tree-node-stop .tn-icon { color: rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.9); }

  .tn-text {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .tree-branch {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    padding-left: var(--space-lg);
    border-left: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
    margin-left: var(--space-md);
    padding-top: var(--space-xs);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .tree-branch-inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 200px;
  }

  .tree-edge {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 4px 0;
  }

  .tree-edge-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .tree-edge-line {
    flex: 1;
    height: 1px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .tree-edge-yes .tree-edge-label { color: rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.7); }
  .tree-edge-no  .tree-edge-label { color: rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.7); }

  .tree-note {
    font-size: 0.83rem;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    padding-top: var(--space-sm);
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-style: italic;
  }
</style>
